# Agent orchestration of the maintainer's Claude Code setup: local to each clone,
# never committed. What is shared with contributors is AGENTS.md, the skills in
# .agents/skills/ and the shape rules in tools/rules/.
# No trailing slash: in a worktree these are symbolic links, not directories.
/CLAUDE.local.md
/.claude/agents
/.claude/hooks
/.claude/tools
/.claude/orchestration.md
/.claude/project.conf
/.claude/test-paths.txt
/.claude/settings.json
/.claude/settings.local.json
/.claude/skills/goal
/.claude/plans
/.claude/state
/.claude/reviews
/.claude/diagnostics
/.claude/security
/.claude/proofs
/.claude/perf
/.claude/tmp
*.snap.new
*.pending-snap
